  "html": "<article id=\"post-5668\" class=\"container post-5668 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry type-of-service-maintenance\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-wrench\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC Maintenance in Columbia, SC</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Effortless seasonal tune-ups every year, scheduled for you, with priority service when demand peaks.</em></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2nd Wind’s maintenance plan ensures regular servicing of heating and cooling systems, optimizing efficiency and preventing costly breakdowns. It includes multiple annual maintenance visits, coil cleaning, filter replacements, discounts on repairs and equipment, and priority scheduling.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Columbia&#8217;s cooling season runs roughly half the year, and that workload is why HVAC maintenance in this market is not optional upkeep. It is what determines whether a system reaches old age. 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning maintains heating and cooling systems across the Midlands, and the Cloud 10 Membership puts that maintenance on a schedule: a spring tune-up before the heat arrives, a fall check before the first cold morning, and a team that already knows your equipment when something fails in between.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(803) 392-1513</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technician performing diagnostic work on a unit in Columbia, SC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 has-secondary-background-color has-background\"><div  class=\"card mt-5 p-3 border-radius-sm flow align-self-center card--wide has-white-background-color\" style=\"\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-decorator h-decorator--primary is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cloud 10 Membership</h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"mt-2 wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong>Cloud 10 Membership</strong> is our maintenance agreement for homeowners who would rather prevent breakdowns than pay for them. Membership includes:</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-3 mt-2 border-radius-xs has-gray-light-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event_blank\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Two maintenance visits per year</strong>, one for cooling and one for heating, plus a third visit in your first membership year. Indoor and outdoor coil cleaning at each service, which restores airflow and efficiency for the long cooling season.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-price-change\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>A 15% discount on repairs, parts and labor included</strong>, with repairs backed by a 1-year parts and labor warranty. 5% discount on equipment, ductwork, indoor air quality products, water heaters, and backup generators.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-clock\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Priority scheduling on all service calls</strong>, so members move to the front of the line when the first heat wave fills the phone lines. During peak weeks, when call volume is highest, member appointments are placed ahead of non-member appointments.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-credit-card\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>5% Discount on All Equipment, Ductwork, IAQ, Water Heaters &amp; Backup Generators:</strong> Upgrade your home comfort systems at a reduced rate, enhancing efficiency and overall performance while saving on new installations and equipment.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-gears\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Reduced diagnostic fee</strong> of $75 instead of $99, with after-hours and holiday visits held at $75 instead of $149.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-dollar-sign\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p><strong>Exclusive Member Referral Program: </strong>A $20 renewal credit for every customer you refer, with no limit. The more you share, the more you save.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mobile-wrap-and-center align-flex-end w100 is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f36ac205 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card__price is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fba139f5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"text-uppercase text-upper wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n</div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta position-relative\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(803) 392-1513</span>\n</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n        <div  class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head\">\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo\">            <svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.3 35.2\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 107.3 35.2;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><title>Google</title><path fill=\"#4885ED\" d=\"M26.4,12.4H13.9v3.7h8.9c-0.4,5.2-4.8,7.4-8.9,7.4c-5.4,0-9.8-4.3-9.8-9.7c0-0.1,0-0.1,0-0.2 c0-5.6,4.4-10,9.8-10c4.2,0,6.7,2.7,6.7,2.7l2.6-2.7c0,0-3.3-3.7-9.4-3.7C6,0,0,6.5,0,13.6c0,6.9,5.6,13.7,14,13.7 c7.3,0,12.7-5,12.7-12.4C26.6,13.3,26.4,12.4,26.4,12.4L26.4,12.4z\"/><g><path id=\"A\" fill=\"#DB3236\" d=\"M36.6,9.7c-5.1,0-8.8,4-8.8,8.7c0,4.8,3.6,8.8,8.9,8.8c4.8,0,8.7-3.7,8.7-8.7 C45.4,12.7,40.9,9.7,36.6,9.7L36.6,9.7z M36.7,13.2c2.5,0,4.9,2,4.9,5.3c0,3.2-2.4,5.3-4.9,5.3c-2.8,0-5-2.2-5-5.3 C31.7,15.4,33.9,13.2,36.7,13.2L36.7,13.2z\"/></g><g><path id=\"A_00000019641008515513977120000006682861592563020936_\" fill=\"#F4C20D\" d=\"M55.8,9.7c-5.1,0-8.8,4-8.8,8.7 c0,4.8,3.6,8.8,8.9,8.8c4.8,0,8.7-3.7,8.7-8.7C64.6,12.7,60,9.7,55.8,9.7L55.8,9.7z M55.9,13.2c2.5,0,4.9,2,4.9,5.3 c0,3.2-2.4,5.3-4.9,5.3c-2.8,0-5-2.2-5-5.3C50.9,15.4,53,13.2,55.9,13.2L55.9,13.2z\"/></g><path fill=\"#4885ED\" d=\"M74.6,9.7c-4.7,0-8.4,4.1-8.4,8.8c0,5.3,4.3,8.8,8.3,8.8c2.5,0,3.8-1,4.8-2.1v1.7c0,3-1.8,4.8-4.6,4.8 c-2.7,0-4-2-4.5-3.1L66.9,30c1.2,2.5,3.6,5.2,7.9,5.2c4.7,0,8.3-3,8.3-9.1V10.3h-3.7v1.5C78.2,10.5,76.7,9.7,74.6,9.7L74.6,9.7z M75,13.2c2.3,0,4.7,2,4.7,5.3c0,3.4-2.4,5.3-4.7,5.3c-2.5,0-4.9-2-4.9-5.3C70.1,15.2,72.5,13.2,75,13.2L75,13.2z\"/><path fill=\"#DB3236\" d=\"M99.4,9.7c-4.4,0-8.2,3.5-8.2,8.8c0,5.5,4.2,8.8,8.6,8.8c3.7,0,6-2,7.4-3.8l-3-2c-0.8,1.2-2.1,2.4-4.3,2.4 c-2.5,0-3.6-1.3-4.3-2.7l11.8-4.9l-0.6-1.4C105.6,12.1,102.9,9.7,99.4,9.7L99.4,9.7z M99.6,13.1c1.6,0,2.8,0.9,3.2,1.9l-7.9,3.3 C94.6,15.7,97,13.1,99.6,13.1L99.6,13.1z\"/><path fill=\"#3CBA54\" d=\"M85.6,26.8h3.9V0.9h-3.9V26.8z\"/></svg>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text\">\n                Reviews <span class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating\"><div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Romesha Ellick\" aria-label=\"Romesha Ellick\">Romesha Ellick</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>2nd Wind was able to come out the same day and look at my HVAC. The tech was nice, professional and direct. He told me exactly what to expect and provided me a good quote. He made the experience very easy.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Matt Marks\" aria-label=\"Matt Marks\">Matt Marks</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Incredibly fast response time. I called on Thursday afternoon and they were installing my unit on Friday morning. The installation itself was also fast. The follow up service was incredibly helpful and reliable.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"George Park\" aria-label=\"George Park\">George Park</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Have used 2nd Wind for the 18 years I have been in my house. They have always been professional and responsive. Today I had them perform a real estate pre-inspection as I prepare to sell my house. Everything checked out perfectly, as I expected, knowing the service they have provided.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignfull is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Maintenance Pays in the Midlands</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Heat transfer is the whole job of an air conditioner, and dirt is heat transfer&#8217;s enemy. A coil coated in pollen and dust forces the system to run longer for the same cooling, which raises the power bill all summer and wears the compressor early. On the heating side, a safety inspection catches cracked heat exchangers and failing ignition components before they become a no-heat call or a carbon monoxide risk. Members also get the small advantage that matters most in July: when demand spikes, their calls are scheduled first.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Maintenance connects to the rest of what we do. A tune-up that finds failing ductwork points to our <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc/air-ducts\">air duct services</a>, and a system past economical repair moves the conversation to our <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc\">cooling</a> or <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc\">heating</a> teams, with video of the condition that drove the recommendation.</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:1em;padding-right:1em;padding-bottom:1em;padding-left:1em\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What a Maintenance Visit Covers</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The spring visit prepares the cooling side: refrigerant charge, indoor and outdoor coil condition, electrical connections, capacitor health, and condensate drainage, which matters in a climate where the drain line runs wet for six months straight. The fall visit prepares the heating side: burners, ignition, safety controls, and a heat exchanger inspection on gas equipment. Both visits catch the quiet failures, such as a weakening capacitor or a fouled coil, while they are still cheap corrections instead of mid-season breakdowns.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5668 -->"
}